  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">概览</span></strong></h1><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这个整合包最初是为朋友设计的，但经过无数小时的打磨后，我决定公开发布，让更多人能享受更好的单方块体验！</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">欢迎分享任何<span style=\"color:#169179\">建议</span>，或报告发现的<span style=\"color:#169179\">漏洞</span>或<span style=\"color:#169179\">错误</span><span style=\"color:#169179\">！</span><br></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">！！！</span>更新整合包前请<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">备份<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">您的</span>存档</span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">！！！</span><br></span></span></h3><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本整合包基于原版\"单方块\"模组，您将出生在一个单独的草方块上，通过破坏它来解锁新阶段并获得更多方块。它包含<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">0</span></strong>个结构模组，因此非常易于更新。</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">性能</span></strong></h1><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">这应该是有史以来</span><strong>性能最高的整合包！</strong>它包含超过<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">45个性能优化模组</span>，一切<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">始于一个单方块</span>，其他模组均为小型附加模组和模组库。其中最大的模组是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a>。</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">常见问题</span></strong></h1><p><span style=\"color:#000\">问：\"如何创建新世界？\"</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>答：目前您必须使用\"创建新世界\"按钮下的\"重新创建\"功能，且仅适用于第一个\"单方块\"（非\"原始\"）世界。</p>\n</div><p><span style=\"color:#000\">问：\"无限耐久？\"</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>关闭方法：打开模组文件夹，删除\"What Durability?\"模组。</p>\n<p>原因：耐久度往往让人感到繁琐而非有意义，尤其当大多数人使用经验修补时，耐久度几乎无关紧要。此模组还能让金质工具变得有用！</p>\n</div><p><span style=\"color:#000\">问：\"恐怖模组？\"</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>答：\"恐怖\"模组名为\"Distant Friends\"。它会在远处生成一些实体，主要使用全黑皮肤。这些身影在被注视时会做出反应，并在您靠近后消失。</p>\n</div><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252frazvangn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090118/description_b209548d-33c6-4553-b2f4-4b01b2e64f44.png\" width=\"476\" height=\"80\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/AeuBs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090118/description_4b9c9228-1223-419b-92e7-756819aad08f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"300\"></a></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\">计划中的功能：</span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>以下模组可能根据兼容性、功能和需求添加或取消：</em><br><br><em>更多独特相关成就。</em><br><em>原版物品的自定义合成配方。</em><br><em>禁止生物破坏地形。</em></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cursery</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblegen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CobbleGen</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchancement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sneaky-curses-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sneaky Curses</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-tabs-updated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tabs</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vectorientation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vectorientation</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mobtimizations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mobtimizations</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-snow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Snow</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smooth-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smooth Particles</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fluid-void-fading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fluid Void Fading</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/whats-that-slot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">What's That Slot?</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-crosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Crosshair</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beneath-the-wetlands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beneath the Wetlands</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backported-spears\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backported Spears</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Portals</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Compass</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Furniture</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fxs-rail-optimization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FX's Rail Optimization</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coffeegs-awful-lightning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoffeeG's Awful Lightning!</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Building But Better</a> vs <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Handcrafted</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-progressive-bosses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progressive Bosses</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillatweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VanillaTweaks</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/odds-ends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Odds &amp; Ends</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-fixes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carpet-Fixes</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goblin-traders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Goblin Traders</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-starlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eternal Starlight</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hold-my-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold my Items</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moreculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreCulling</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blanket\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blanket</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/everything-animated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Everything Animated!</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky OneBlock - Lucky Blocks</a></p>",
